   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tin Soldier**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **bs2020-09-13t02**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **bs2020-09-13t03**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **bs2020-09-13t04**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **bs2020-09-13t05**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **bs2020-09-13t06**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **bs2020-09-13t07**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **bs2020-09-13t08**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2020-09-16** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 132 min [1]. Said about its sound: Occasional clipping caused by strong winds, mainly in the first set [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2020-09-16**: taped by Kelly Casey; transferred by Kelly Casey; source: From Fifth Row just Left of Center on Top of Our Van Lift Gate > Internal Microphones Tascam DR-100mkII > SDHC 24/48k [1]. Also: Transferred from SDHC to PC, processed in Audacity, and saved as 24/48k FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings McHenry Outdoor Theater - McHenry, IL - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/mchenry-outdoor-theater-mchenry-il/) [3]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings McHenry Outdoor Theater - McHenry, IL - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/mchenry-outdoor-theater-mchenry-il-2/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings McHenry Outdoor Theater - McHenry, IL - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/mchenry-outdoor-theater-mchenry-il/) [5]",
